title: "A recorded class ends"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Class running
    lg1: Recording being built
    lg2: Done
    lg3: Recording trouble
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 yellow
  class lg2 blue
  class lg3 orange
  s0: Class running, recording
  s1: Ending the class, recording
  s2: Class running, recording failed
  s3: Class ended, recording is being built
  s4: Ending the class, recording failed
  s5: Class ended, recording failed
  s6: Class ended, recording ready
  s7: Class ended, building failed 1 of 3 times
  s8: Class ended, building failed 2 of 3 times
  s9: Class ended, building failed 3 of 3 times
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the host ends the call, or the time limit arrives
  s0 --> s2: the recorder fails
  s1 --> s0: the call cannot be ended after 100 tries, it runs on
  s1 --> s3: everyone is removed and the call ends
  s1 --> s4: the recorder fails
  s2 --> s0: the host starts the recording again
  s2 --> s4: the host ends the call, or the time limit arrives
  s3 --> s6: the recording is ready
  s3 --> s7: building the recording fails
  s4 --> s2: the call cannot be ended after 100 tries, it runs on
  s4 --> s5: everyone is removed and the call ends
  s7 --> s3: building starts again
  s3 --> s8: building the recording fails
  s8 --> s3: building starts again
  s3 --> s9: building the recording fails
  s9 --> s5: the third try fails
